OL,3,GNEWSACouncils consider binning waste
OL,4,Atreatment centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo councils in Derbyshire could
OL,7,F"decommission and dispose of" a waste
OL,8,Ftreatment centre after failing to find
OL,9,Fan operator for the site.
OL,11,FThe Sinfin Waste Treatment Centre in
OL,12,FDerby has never been used after it
OL,13,Ffailed initial testing in 2017, and
OL,14,Ftalks earlier this year were unable to
OL,15,Ffind anyone to take on management of
OL,16,Fthe project.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
