OL,3,GNEWSACouncils consider binning waste
OL,4,Atreatment centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby City Council and Derbyshire
OL,7,FCounty Council, which jointly own the
OL,8,Fsite, said a "comprehensive review"
OL,9,Ffound getting rid of the rubbish
OL,10,Fincinerator would be "the best option
OL,11,Fto protect the interests of council
OL,12,Ftaxpayers".
OL,14,FThe authorities said the scheme had
OL,15,Fcost them a combined #147.33m to date.
